Quick notes:

I learn new stuff with every game I play; somehow I'd never used the
travel (_) command before!?!  Turns out it's both a real-time time
saver and considerably safer than mashing directional keys at high
speeds.

This is also the first game I've ever really taken advantage of having
powerful pets... I polytrap-danced a large dog into Arf the invisible
Titan, who crushed pretty much everything through the early and middle
game... especially when I received Frost Brand as a second sac gift
after Magicbane :)  At one point I had as many as four purple worms as
pets.  The hardiest of these, Daggermouth, made it with me all the way
to the Plane of Fire (where I left him behind because I didn't realize
he was still eating.)

I somehow never acquired teleportitis, despite eating multiple nymph
corpses after reaching XL:17.  It didn't really slow me down on the
ascension run (<2000 turns) because the mysterious force only got me
once.

Also fun: I confused Vlad with a blow from Magicbane, only to watch
him read a scroll of teleport and vanish into thin air!  I found him
on dlvl14.

This marks my seventh ascension, each with a different class.  Done
are (in order)
Valkyrie
Monk
Tourist
Barbarian
Samurai
Priest
Wizard

Still to come are (in no order)
Rogue
Ranger
Healer
Archaeologist
Caveman
Knight

I'm past the halfway point :)


